[{"sha":"481fc98eaf872b41591eab0be87b095affcf02e5","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDQ4MWZjOThlYWY4NzJiNDE1OTFlYWIwYmU4N2IwOTVhZmZjZjAyZTU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/481fc98eaf872b41591eab0be87b095affcf02e5","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/481fc98eaf872b41591eab0be87b095affcf02e5","author":{"name":"Jonathan Scoresby","email":"jonathan@scoresby.tech","date":"2026-05-30T16:15:09Z"},"committer":{"name":"Jonathan Scoresby","email":"jonathan@scoresby.tech","date":"2026-06-07T06:49:30Z"},"tree":{"sha":"7bb33502b84c4c1493d0155dfd963d1f596f164e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/7bb33502b84c4c1493d0155dfd963d1f596f164e"},"message":"policy, types, state: add policy DNS profiles\n\nFixes #3012.\n\nThe policy file gains a top-level \"dns\" block: a list of DNS overrides\nlayered on top of headscale.yaml's tailnet-wide dns config. Each profile\ncarries an assignment list (groups / users / tags) plus an optional set\nof body fields (nameservers, overrideLocalDNS, split, searchDomains).\nA node matched by a profile gets that profile's fields layered on top\nof the base; a node matched by no profile receives the base unchanged.\nProfile changes are hot-reloaded with the policy file.\n\nMatching is by tier — tag > user > group — and by profile list order\nwithin each tier. Tagged nodes consult only the tag tier.\n\nBody field semantics:\n\n  - Nameservers + OverrideLocalDNS: together describe one logical \"where\n    do my resolvers go on the wire\" decision. The base has nameservers\n    in either Resolvers (when overriding) or FallbackResolvers (when\n    not). A profile may set Nameservers (new addresses), OverrideLocalDNS\n    (re-route inherited addresses between the two wire fields), both,\n    or neither. Pointer-typed so present-vs-absent semantics are\n    distinguishable from zero values.\n  - Split: when present, replaces Routes; when absent, inherits.\n  - SearchDomains: when present, replaces the search-domain portion of\n    Domains preserving base_domain; when absent, inherits.\n\nValidation rejects:\n\n  - Profiles with no assignment list (no groups, users, or tags) — they\n    could never match any node.\n  - Any group / user / tag appearing in more than one profile's\n    assignment list.\n  - References to undefined groups or tags, malformed usernames.\n\nPolicyManager interface gains NodeDNSConfig. The state package gains a\nthin passthrough. generateDNSConfig takes the state via a narrow\ndnsConfigStater interface so the lookup can be exercised in isolation.","parents":[{"sha":"29f87e5eaa7bd5509582d2f8626aee7f602db948","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/29f87e5eaa7bd5509582d2f8626aee7f602db948","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/29f87e5eaa7bd5509582d2f8626aee7f602db948"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":26435931253,"node_id":"RRE_lADOEFLz888AAAABEpKDNc8AAAAGJ7RMdQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/26435931253","actor":{"login":"jonscoresby","id":37129900,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MTI5OTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37129900?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonscoresby","html_url":"https://github.com/jonscoresby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonscoresby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonscoresby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonscoresby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonscoresby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonscoresby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonscoresby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonscoresby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonscoresby/events{/privacy}","received_events